# Tribunal "The Goblin Army": Fedris Hler in the Temple Reception Area, asked
# about service to our Lady and the matters to discuss, tells of the king's new
# recruits (10), the goblin army (20) and its Altmer trainers
# (30). The second goblin warchief to die in the Tears of Amun-Shae logs 50
# (goblinchiefScript1/2); the trainers Armion and Yarnar in Teran Hall's East
# Building log 57 and 58 (armionScript, yarnarScript). With all four dead,
# Fedris pays 15000 (100).
# The kills stand in for the fights; `defend` takes the goblins that join in.
# Ref FormIDs carry Tribunal.esm's slot 06.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_tr09_journalist --timeout 2400
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tr_kill_goblins
run
player->PositionCell -116 483 -684 0 "Mournhold Temple: Reception Area"
until 600 "fedris hler"->GetDistance player < 4000
talk fedris hler
ask service to our Lady
ask matters to discuss
ask new recruits
expect GetJournalIndex TR_KillGoblins == 10
ask goblin army
expect GetJournalIndex TR_KillGoblins == 20
ask Altmer trainers
expect GetJournalIndex TR_KillGoblins == 30
bye
defend
run
player->PositionCell -4573 2855 975 0 "Old Mournhold: Tears of Amun-Shae"
until 300 GetPCCell "Old Mournhold: Tears of Amun-Shae" == 1
wait 300
console 06A5CF20.kill
console 069D675F.kill
until 600 GetJournalIndex TR_KillGoblins == 50
run
player->PositionCell 3443 2198 -346 0 "Old Mournhold: Teran Hall, East Bldg"
until 300 GetPCCell "Old Mournhold: Teran Hall, East Bldg" == 1
wait 300
console 06E27A85.kill
console 069A3FEC.kill
until 600 GetDeadCount "armion" >= 1
until 600 GetDeadCount "yarnar" >= 1
run
player->PositionCell -116 483 -684 0 "Mournhold Temple: Reception Area"
until 600 "fedris hler"->GetDistance player < 4000
talk fedris hler
ask goblin army
expect GetJournalIndex TR_KillGoblins == 100
bye
end
